{"3949460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Phantom Fools", "steam_appid": 3949460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A roguelike game about poltergeist ghosts</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a gang of imprisoned ghosts escaping from a medieval castle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/26498cc30e1edba07095eafc0e9b9b8c.poster.avif?t=1781823064\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/26498cc30e1edba07095eafc0e9b9b8c.webm?t=1781823064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/26498cc30e1edba07095eafc0e9b9b8c.mp4?t=1781823064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possess castle objects — and turn swords, candlesticks, barrels, and much more into weapons against your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/f1af28965af015ba739db336a17f985f.poster.avif?t=1781823064\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/f1af28965af015ba739db336a17f985f.webm?t=1781823064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/f1af28965af015ba739db336a17f985f.mp4?t=1781823064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every escape is a new run. Collect skills, choose upgrades, combine abilities, and try out different builds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/beae51efcb85d4ec9d0d803a16a6968f.avif?t=1781823064\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras_big/beae51efcb85d4ec9d0d803a16a6968f.webp?t=1781823064 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the “<strong>Symbiote</strong>” ability to temporarily take the form of enemies — and even some bosses — using their power in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/795194f74d7b1f1764ffae79e3462584.avif?t=1781823064\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras_big/795194f74d7b1f1764ffae79e3462584.avif?t=1781823064 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your Fool, level up your symbiotes, and customize your hero’s appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras/090ae5ec72cc7e064dc877652cfaa12d.avif?t=1781823064\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949460/extras_big/090ae5ec72cc7e064dc877652cfaa12d.avif?t=1781823064 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A roguelike game about poltergeist ghosts</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a gang of imprisoned ghosts escaping from a medieval castle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsin